    {
      "id": "claim_c6087cc73a12472f8dd07cf83895cf94",
      "statement": "open() runs ensureObserver only for non-owners after the sharing-graph role is confirmed, so the observer flow never reveals gatekeeper or resource metadata to an unauthorized user; opening requires both a reachable sharing-graph role and a complete verified observer record.",
      "evidence": [
