      "statement": "Forward exclusion: authorizeObservation blocks the observation outright if any named excludeObservers id maps to a still-authorized observer; named observers who have already lost access are torn down (record deleted, removeObserver on all gatekeeper facets) and the observation proceeds; unknown ids are ignored.",
