      "statement": "Observer re-verification runs on every open so upstream revocation of resource access is caught promptly (gatekeepers choose their own caching tradeoff), and the overseer deliberately treats every verification failure as repairable — a settled denial and an expired credential both arrive as thrown errors, which is why the integration fixture distinguishes narratives by reason text.",
